; THE CORE SYSTEM GOES LAST, after the three mt_ traits. The character sheet draws traits in ARRAY
; order and the sheet prints Rend, Uncertainty Field, Fade Strike before the core, so this order is
; player-visible; test_maidens_blush_frame.gd pins it exactly.
traits = Array[ExtResource("8_kit")]([ExtResource("10_rend"), ExtResource("11_field"), ExtResource("12_fade"), ExtResource("13_core")])
